title: "Deterministic Intent Translation: Implementation, Benchmarks and Reproducibility Artifacts"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation, frozen benchmarks, experiment runners and
  per-case evidence for a deterministic failure-containment cascade that
  validates LLM-produced network-slicing intent descriptors before actuation.
